# Launcher

This **is** the product: a native macOS desktop app (Swift + SwiftUI).

- Verbs: Play, Stop, Locate. Operator console on this Mac: show Wine, prefix, PID, env, logs (ADR-009).
- Detection: local Steam library + pinned profiles + folder picker.
- Talk to `runtime/` over local CLI or XPC. No cloud API.
- Copy: operator UI may name Wine / DXVK / prefix. Do not clone Steam's UI.
- Title logic: Apex then Rivals pinned. Steam catalog fills the rest. Spider-Man is not listed unless it is in the local Steam library.

UI uses `Theme.swift` (Vercel/Geist). No store, accounts, or animated brand shell.
